  "notes": "Size variants of one release are inline variants; each size has pre-trained and instruction-tuned (-it) checkpoints. Multi-token prediction drafters for the four launch sizes followed on 2026-04-16 (Gemma releases page). Google says Gemma 4 is built from the same research and technology as Gemini 3; no lineage to a specific Gemini model is stated. A DiffusionGemma 26B A4B repository sits in the same Hugging Face collection but is not treated as a Gemma 4 size here."
